# Build from the sotto-agent context; include only runtime sources, published skills,
# Python compatibility files and the existing hashed requirements lock.
**
!runtime/
runtime/*
!runtime/sotto-chat/
runtime/sotto-chat/*
!runtime/sotto-chat/package.json
!runtime/sotto-chat/package-lock.json
!runtime/sotto-chat/tsconfig.json
!runtime/sotto-chat/tsconfig.build.json
!runtime/sotto-chat/src/
!runtime/sotto-chat/src/**

!runtime/trigger-receiver/
runtime/trigger-receiver/*
!runtime/trigger-receiver/*.py
!runtime/trigger-receiver/static/
!runtime/trigger-receiver/static/**
runtime/trigger-receiver/test_*.py

!adapters/
adapters/*
!adapters/sotto/
!adapters/sotto/**
!sotto-chief-of-staff/
!sotto-chief-of-staff/**
!requirements.txt
!VERSION
!docs/
docs/*
!docs/playground-architecture.html
!docs/playground-feedback-loops.html

# Generated/runtime/user state and local credentials never enter this image build context.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*runtime*.json
**/*credentials*.json
**/token*
**/*secret*
**/evals/corpus/
**/evals/baselines/*
# Mirrors the root .gitignore and the publish CORPUS GUARD (checked by
# sotto-chief-of-staff/tests/test_build_context_privacy.py).
**/*signing.key
**/bridge-access-codes.log
**/corpus-v*
**/*.map.json
**/labels*.yaml
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
